<title>SPAIN: Banco Popular to pay 255 ptas gross interim div.</title>
<headline>Banco Popular to pay 255 ptas gross interim div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular said on Monday it is to pay its second interim dividend, of 255 pesetas gross per share against 1996 results, on January 4.</p>
<p>Popular said this is equivalent to 191.25 pesetas net per share.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
